 und Modi."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A pantalla completa, uno tras otro. ▲ ▼ explorar, ◀ ▶ buscar, clic para info y modos."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全画面で1つずつ表示。▲ ▼ で切り替え、◀ ▶ でシーク、クリックで情報とモード。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Во весь экран, одна за другой. ▲ ▼ — просмотр, ◀ ▶ — перемотка, нажатие — сведения и режимы."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fuld skærm, én efter én. ▲ ▼ gennemse, ◀ ▶ spol, klik for info og tilstande."}}}},"hint_generate_heatmaps_and_speeds_for":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generer heatmaps og hastigheder til interaktive scener"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Генерация тепловых карт и скоростей для интерактивных сцен"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"인터랙티브 영상의 히트맵 및 속도 생성"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generate heatmaps and speeds for interactive scenes"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Heatmaps und Geschwindigkeiten für interaktive Szenen generieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generar mapas de calor y velocidades para escenas interactivas"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"インタラクティブシーンのヒートマップと速度を生成"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Genera heatmap e velocità per le scene interattive"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generuj mapy cieplne i prędkości dla scen interaktywnych"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Générer des cartes thermiques et vitesses pour les scènes interactives"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gerar mapas de calor e velocidades para cenas interativas"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Genereer heatmaps en snelheden voor interactieve scènes"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generer varmekart og hastigheter for interaktive scener"}}