iltret finns kvar på servern."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa „%@” z Dashboardu. Sam zapisany filtr pozostaje na serwerze."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retire « %@ » du Dashboard. Le filtre enregistré reste sur le serveur."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner \"%@\" fra Dashboard. Selve det gemte filter bliver på serveren."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dashboard에서 \"%@\"을(를) 제거합니다. 저장된 필터 자체는 서버에 남아 있습니다."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Убирает «%@» с Dashboard. Сам сохраненный фильтр остается на сервере."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert '%@' van het dashboard. Het bewaarde filter zelf blijft op de server."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner «%@» fra Dashboard. Selve det lagrede filteret blir værende på serveren."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove \"%@\" dalla dashboard. Il filtro salvato resta sul server."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quita «%@» del Dashboard. El filtro guardado sigue en el servidor."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」をDashboardから削除します。保存済みフィルター自体はサーバーに残ります。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove \"%@\" do Dashboard. O filtro salvo em si continua no servidor."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes \"%@\" from the dashboard. The saved filter itself stays on the server."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt „%@“ aus dem Dashboard. Der gespeicherte Filter selbst bleibt auf dem Server."}}}},"hint_removes_cached_artwork_for_active":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina las imágenes en caché del servidor activo. Se vuelven a descargar cuando aparecen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes the cached artwork for the active server. Images are downloaded again as they appear."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort cachade bilder för den aktiva servern. Bilderna laddas ner igen när de visas."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove le immagini in cache del server attivo. Le immagini vengono riscaricate quando appaiono."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa zapisane grafiki aktywnego serwera. Obrazy zostaną ponownie pobrane, gdy się pojawią."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de cachelagrede billeder for den aktive server. Billederne downloades igen, når de vises."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет кэш изображений активного сервера. Изображения будут загружены снова при появлении."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使用中のサーバーのキャッシュ画像を削除します。画像は表示されるときに再ダウンロードされます。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de bufrede bildene for den aktive serveren. Bildene lastes ned på nytt når de vises."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert de bewaarde illustraties voor de actieve server. Afbeeldingen worden opnieuw gedownload zodra ze verschijnen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt die zwischengespeicherten Bilder des aktiven Servers. Bilder werden beim Anzeigen neu geladen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les illustrations en cache du serveur actif. Les images sont retéléchargées lorsqu'elles apparaissent."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"활성 서버의 캐시된 아트워크를 제거합니다. 이미지는 표시될 때 다시 다운로드됩니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove as imagens em cache do servidor ativo. As imagens são baixadas novamente quando aparecerem."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除使用中伺服器的快取插圖。圖片會在顯示時重新下載。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Etkin sunucunun önbelleğe alınmış görsellerini kaldırır. Resimler göründükçe yeniden indirilir."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除当前服务器的缓存图片。图片再次出现时会重新下载。"}}}},"hint_removes_downloaded_speech_models_and":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İndirilen konuşma modellerini ve çeviri paketlerini kaldırır. AI altyazılar gerektiğinde bunları yeniden indirir."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除已下载的语音模型和翻译包。AI 字幕会在需要时重新下载它们。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除已下載的語音模型和翻譯套件。AI 字幕會在需要時重新下載。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina los modelos de voz y los paquetes de traducción descargados. Los subtítulos con IA los vuelven a descargar cuando hace falta."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダウンロード済みの音声モデルと翻訳パックを削除します。AI字幕は必要に応じて再ダウンロードします。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет загруженные речевые модели и пакеты перевода. ИИ-субтитры загрузят их снова при необходимости."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort nedladdade talmodeller och översättningspaket. AI-undertexter laddar ner dem igen vid behov."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove os modelos de fala e pacotes de tradução baixados. As legendas por IA os baixam novamente quando necessário."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt die geladenen Sprachmodelle und Übersetzungspakete. KI-Untertitel laden sie bei Bedarf erneut."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de downloadede talemodeller og oversættelsespakker. AI-undertekster downloader dem igen efter behov."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"다운로드한 음성 모델과 번역 팩을 제거합니다. AI 자막이 필요할 때 다시 다운로드합니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes the downloaded speech models and translation packs. AI subtitles download them again when needed."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa pobrane modele mowy i pakiety tłumaczeń. Napisy AI pobiorą je ponownie w razie potrzeby."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert de gedownloade spraakmodellen en vertaalpakketten. AI-ondertiteling downloadt ze opnieuw wanneer nodig."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les modèles vocaux et packs de traduction téléchargés. Les sous-titres IA les retéléchargent au besoin."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove i modelli vocali e i pacchetti di traduzione scaricati. I sottotitoli IA li riscaricano quando servono."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner nedlastede talemodeller og oversettelsespakker. AI-undertekster laster dem ned igjen ved behov."}}}},"hint_removes_scenes_images_and_galleries":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ファイルが存在しなくなったシーン、画像、ギャラリーを、生成されたファイルとともに削除します。この操作は取り消せません。ドライランではサーバーログへの書き込みのみ行います。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt Szenen, Bilder und Galerien, deren Dateien nicht mehr existieren, samt ihren generierten Dateien. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Ein Probelauf schreibt nur ins Server-Log."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa sceny, obrazy i galerie, których pliki już nie istnieją, wraz z wygenerowanymi plikami. Tej operacji nie można cofnąć. Próba na sucho zapisuje tylko w dzienniku serwera."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет сцены, изображения и галереи, файлов которых больше нет, вместе с их сгенерированными файлами. Это действие нельзя отменить. Пробный запуск только пишет в журнал сервера."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove scene, immagini e gallerie i cui file non esistono più, insieme ai file generati. Questa azione non può essere annullata. Una simulazione scrive solo nel log del server."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les scènes, images et galeries dont les fichiers n'existent plus, ainsi que leurs fichiers générés. Cette action est irréversible. Une simulation écrit seulement dans le journal du serveur."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner scener, bilder og gallerier der filene ikke lenger finnes, sammen med de genererte filene. Dette kan ikke angres. En prøvekjøring skriver bare til serverloggen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina escenas, imágenes y galerías cuyos archivos ya no existen, junto con sus archivos generados. Esta acción no se puede deshacer. Una simulación solo escribe en el registro del servidor."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes scenes, images and galleries whose files no longer exist, with their generated files. This cannot be undone. A dry run only writes to the server log."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner scener, billeder og gallerier, hvis filer ikke længere findes, sammen med deres genererede filer. Det kan ikke fortrydes. En prøvekørsel skriver kun til serverloggen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert scènes, afbeeldingen en galerijen waarvan de bestanden niet meer bestaan, met hun gegenereerde bestanden. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt. Een proefrun schrijft alleen naar het serverlogboek."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"파일이 더 이상 존재하지 않는 영상, 이미지 및 갤러리를 생성된 파일과 함께 제거합니다. 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다. 테스트 실행은 서버 로그에만 기록합니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove cenas, imagens e galerias cujos arquivos não existem mais, junto com seus arquivos gerados. Não é possível desfazer. Uma simulação apenas escreve no log do servidor."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dosyaları artık bulunmayan sahneleri, resimleri ve galerileri, oluşturulan dosyalarıyla birlikte kaldırır. Bu işlem geri alınamaz. Deneme çalıştırması yalnızca sunucu günlüğüne yazar."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort scener, bilder och gallerier vars filer inte längre finns, tillsammans med deras genererade filer. Det går inte att ångra. En testkörning skriver bara till serverloggen."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除檔案已不存在的短片、圖片和圖庫，以及其產生的檔案。此動作無法還原。試執行只會寫入伺服器日誌。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除文件已不存在的短片、图片和图库及其生成的文件。此操作无法撤销。试运行只会写入服务器日志。"}}}},"hint_remove_this_filter_this_cannot":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu filtre kaldırılsın mı? Bu işlem geri alınamaz."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要移除此过滤器吗？此操作无法撤销。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要移除此篩選條件嗎？此動作無法還原。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ta bort det här filtret? Det går inte att ångra."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Quitar este filtro? Esta acción no se puede deshacer."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retirer ce filtre ? Cette action est irréversible."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usunąć ten filtr? Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remover este filtro? Não é possível desfazer."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Diesen Filter entfernen? Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 필터를 제거하겠습니까? 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove this filter? This cannot be undone."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このフィルターを削除しますか？この操作は取り消せません。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerne dette filteret? Dette kan ikke angres."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuovere questo filtro? Questa azione non può essere annullata."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dit filter verwijderen? Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjern dette filter? Det kan ikke fortrydes."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удалить этот фильтр? Это действие нельзя отменить."}}}},"hint_renames_selected_stash_saved_filter":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Omdøber det valgte gemte Stash-filter eller filter på enheden."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Переименовывает выбранный сохраненный фильтр Stash или фильтр на устройстве."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renames the selected Stash saved filter or on-device filter."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"선택한 Stash 저장된 필터 또는 기기 내 필터의 이름을 변경합니다."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選択したStashの保存済みフィルターまたはデバイス上のフィルターの名前を変更します。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zmienia nazwę wybranego zapisanego filtra Stash lub filtra na urządzeniu."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renombra el filtro guardado de Stash o el filtro del dispositivo seleccionado."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wijzigt de naam van het geselecteerde bewaarde Stash-filter of apparaatfilter."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Benennt den gewählten gespeicherten Stash-Filter oder Gerätefilter um."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renomme le filtre enregistré Stash ou le filtre local sélectionné."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rinomina il filtro salvato di Stash o il filtro sul dispositivo selezionato."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renomeia o filtro salvo do Stash ou o filtro do dispositivo selecionado."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gir det valgte lagrede Stash-filteret eller filteret på enheten nytt navn."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重命名所选的 Stash 已存过滤器或设备上的过滤器。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Byter namn på valt sparat Stash-filter eller filter på enheten."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重新命名所選的 Stash 已儲存篩選條件或裝置上的篩選條件。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Seçili Stash kayıtlı filtresini veya aygıttaki filtreyi yeniden adlandırır."}}}},"hint_rename_this_preset_or_saved":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重命名此预设或已存过滤器。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu hazır ayarı veya kayıtlı filtreyi yeniden adlandır."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Byt namn på förinställningen eller det sparade filtret."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重新命名此預設組合或已儲存的篩選條件。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 프리셋 또는 저장된 필터의 이름을 변경합니다."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wijzig de naam van deze voorinstelling of dit bewaarde filter."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rename this preset or saved filter."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このプリセットまたは保存済みフィルターの名前を変更します。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gi denne forhåndsinnstillingen eller det lagrede filteret nytt navn."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renommez ce préréglage ou ce filtre enregistré."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieses Preset oder diesen gespeicherten Filter umbenennen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zmień nazwę tego ustawienia wstępnego lub zapisanego filtra."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renomeie esta predefinição ou filtro salvo."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renombra este preajuste o filtro guardado."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rinomina questo preset o filtro salvato."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Omdøb denne forudindstilling eller dette gemte filter."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Переименуйте этот шаблон или сохраненный фильтр.